Headers: {"accept":"application/json","anthropic-beta":"interleaved-thinking-2025-05-14","anthropic-dangerous-direct-browser-access":"true","anthropic-version":"2023-06-01","authorization":"[REDACTED]","content-type":"application/json","user-agent":"claude-cli/2.1.1 (external, claude-vscode, agent-sdk/0.2.1)","x-api-key":"[REDACTED]","x-app":"cli","x-stainless-arch":"arm64","x-stainless-helper-method":"stream","x-stainless-lang":"js","x-stainless-os":"MacOS","x-stainless-package-version":"0.70.0","x-stainless-retry-count":"0","x-stainless-runtime":"node","x-stainless-runtime-version":"v24.3.0","x-stainless-timeout":"300000","connection":"keep-alive","host":"localhost:8787","accept-encoding":"gzip, deflate, br, zstd","content-length":"8415"}
Body: {"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","messages":[{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Command: npm run get_schema -- semantic.dm_orders_shopify\nOutput: \n> data-analysis-skill@1.0.0 get_schema\n> tsx scripts/get_schema.ts semantic.dm_orders_shopify\n\nSchema for table \"semantic.dm_orders_shopify\":\n[\n  {\n    \"column_name\": \"tenant_id\",\n    \"data_type\": \"uuid\",\n    \"is_nullable\": true,\n    \"column_default\": null,\n    \"description\": \"[FK] Shop UUID. JOIN with dm_shop_info_shopify.tenant_id for currency/timezone\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"column_name\": \"order_id\",\n    \"data_type\": \"text\",\n    \"is_nullable\": true,\n    \"column_default\": null,\n    \"description\": \"[PK] Unique order identifier. Use for JOIN with dm_order_items_shopify.order_id\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"column_name\": \"platform\",\n    \"data_type\": \"text\",\n    \"is_nullable\": true,\n    \"column_default\": null,\n    \"description\": \"[Platform] Platform identifier. Always \\\"shopify\\\" for this table\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"column_name\": \"shop_domain\",\n    \"data_type\": \"text\",\n    \"is_nullable\": true,\n    \"column_default\": null,\n    \"description\": \"[Context] Shop domain. Use for multi-store filtering: GROUP BY shop_domain\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"column_name\": \"order_number\",\n    \"data_type\": \"text\",\n    \"is_nullable\": true,\n    \"column_default\": null,\n    \"description\": \"[Display] Human-readable order #. Example: #1001, #1002. Use in customer reports\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"column_name\": \"landing_site\",\n    \"data_type\": \"text\",\n    \"is_nullable\": true,\n    \"column_default\": null,\n    \"description\": \"[Context] Landing page URL. Use for traffic source analysis\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"column_name\": \"referring_site\",\n    \"data_type\": \"text\",\n    \"is_nullable\": true,\n    \"column_default\": null,\n    \"description\": \"[Traffic] Referrer URL. Use for referral traffic analysis\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"column_name\": \"source_name\",\n    \"data_type\": \"text\",\n    \"is_nullable\": true,\n    \"column_default\": null,\n    \"description\": \"[Channel] Sales channel. Values: web, pos, iphone, android. GROUP BY source_name for channel breakdown\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"column_name\": \"gateway\",\n    \"data_type\": \"text\",\n    \"is_nullable\": true,\n    \"column_default\": null,\n    \"description\": \"[Payment] Payment processor. Values: stripe, paypal, shopify_payments. GROUP BY gateway for payment analysis\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"column_name\": \"processing_method\",\n    \"data_type\": \"text\",\n    \"is_nullable\": true,\n    \"column_default\": null,\n    \"description\": \"[Method] Payment processing method. Values: direct, checkout, express, manual\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"column_name\": \"total_price\",\n    \"data_type\": \"numeric\",\n    \"is_nullable\": true,\n    \"column_default\": null,\n    \"description\": \"[Revenue] ORDER TOTAL = subtotal + tax + shipping - discounts. CRITICAL: Use SUM(total_price) for revenue metrics\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"column_name\": \"subtotal_price\",\n    \"data_type\": \"numeric\",\n    \"is_nullable\": true,\n    \"column_default\": null,\n    \"description\": \"[Revenue] Merchandise total before tax/shipping. Use for AOV: AVG(subtotal_price)\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"column_name\": \"total_discounts\",\n    \"data_type\": \"numeric\",\n    \"is_nullable\": true,\n    \"column_default\": null,\n    \"description\": \"[Revenue] Total discount amount. Use discount rate: SUM(total_discounts) / SUM(subtotal_price)\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"column_name\": \"total_tax\",\n    \"data_type\": \"numeric\",\n    \"is_nullable\": true,\n    \"column_default\": null,\n    \"description\": \"[Revenue] Total tax charged. Use for tax reporting: SUM(total_tax) WHERE DATE_TRUNC('month', created_at) = '2025-01-01'\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"column_name\": \"currency\",\n    \"data_type\": \"text\",\n    \"is_nullable\": true,\n    \"column_default\": null,\n    \"description\": \"[Currency] ISO 4217 code (USD, EUR, GBP). Use for multi-currency: GROUP BY currency\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"column_name\": \"financial_status\",\n    \"data_type\": \"text\",\n    \"is_nullable\": true,\n    \"column_default\": null,\n    \"description\": \"[Status] Payment state. Values: paid, pending, authorized, partially_paid, voided. Filter: WHERE financial_status = 'paid'\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"column_name\": \"fulfillment_status\",\n    \"data_type\": \"text\",\n    \"is_nullable\": true,\n    \"column_default\": null,\n    \"description\": \"[Status] Shipping state. Values: fulfilled, partial, restocked, null. Filter: WHERE fulfillment_status = 'fulfilled'\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"column_name\": \"cancelled_at\",\n    \"data_type\": \"timestamp with time zone\",\n    \"is_nullable\": true,\n    \"column_default\": null,\n    \"description\": \"[Timestamp] Cancellation date. Filter: WHERE cancelled_at IS NOT NULL for cancelled orders\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"column_name\": \"cancel_reason\",\n    \"data_type\": \"text\",\n    \"is_nullable\": true,\n    \"column_default\": null,\n    \"description\": \"[Status] Cancellation reason. Values: customer, inventory, fraud, other. GROUP BY for cancellation analysis\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"column_name\": \"customer_id\",\n    \"data_type\": \"text\",\n    \"is_nullable\": true,\n    \"column_default\": null,\n    \"description\": \"[FK] Customer identifier. JOIN with dm_customers_shopify.customer_id for CLV analysis\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"column_name\": \"customer_email\",\n    \"data_type\": \"text\",\n    \"is_nullable\": true,\n    \"column_default\": null,\n    \"description\": \"[Contact] Customer email. Use for matching across systems or email marketing analytics\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"column_name\": \"tags\",\n    \"data_type\": \"text\",\n    \"is_nullable\": true,\n    \"column_default\": null,\n    \"description\": \"[Metadata] Comma-separated tags. Use for custom filters: WHERE tags LIKE '%vip%'\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"column_name\": \"line_items_count\",\n    \"data_type\": \"integer\",\n    \"is_nullable\": true,\n    \"column_default\": null,\n    \"description\": \"[Metric] Number of products in cart. Use for basket size: AVG(line_items_count)\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"column_name\": \"created_at\",\n    \"data_type\": \"timestamp with time zone\",\n    \"is_nullable\": true,\n    \"column_default\": null,\n    \"description\": \"[Timestamp] Order date/time. CRITICAL for time-series: GROUP BY DATE_TRUNC('day', created_at)\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"column_name\": \"updated_at\",\n    \"data_type\": \"timestamp with time zone\",\n    \"is_nullable\": true,\n    \"column_default\": null,\n    \"description\": \"[Timestamp] Last update time. Use for change tracking: WHERE updated_at > created_at\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"column_name\": \"raw\",\n    \"data_type\": \"jsonb\",\n    \"is_nullable\": true,\n    \"column_default\": null,\n    \"description\": \"[Raw] Original API response JSONB. Use for debugging or extracting additional fields\"\n  }\n]\n\n"}]}],"system":[{"type":"text","text":"You are a Claude agent, built on Anthropic's Claude Agent SDK."},{"type":"text","text":"Extract any file paths that this command reads or modifies. For commands like \"git diff\" and \"cat\", include the paths of files being shown. Use paths verbatim -- don't add any slashes or try to resolve them. Do not try to infer paths that were not explicitly listed in the command output.\n\nIMPORTANT: Commands that do not display the contents of the files should not return any filepaths. For eg. \"ls\", pwd\", \"find\". Even more complicated commands that don't display the contents should not be considered: eg \"find . -type f -exec ls -la {} + | sort -k5 -nr | head -5\"\n\nFirst, determine if the command displays the contents of the files. If it does, then <is_displaying_contents> tag should be true. If it does not, then <is_displaying_contents> tag should be false.\n\nFormat your response as:\n<is_displaying_contents>\ntrue\n</is_displaying_contents>\n\n<filepaths>\npath/to/file1\npath/to/file2\n</filepaths>\n\nIf no files are read or modified, return empty filepaths tags:\n<filepaths>\n</filepaths>\n\nDo not include any other text in your response."}],"tools":[],"metadata":{"user_id":"user_8c51390cef627ddfb6b4b23b54bfc71738a35d5a5d4a5d6c9a8b5bf17b55c2c7_account__session_526e4945-5391-4f8e-b27f-7b7d5d8ac671"},"max_tokens":32000,"stream":true}
