Body: {"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","messages":[{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Command: npm run get_schema -- semantic.dm_customers_shopify\nOutput: \n> data-analysis-skill@1.0.0 get_schema\n> tsx scripts/get_schema.ts semantic.dm_customers_shopify\n\nSchema for table \"semantic.dm_customers_shopify\":\n[\n  {\n    \"column_name\": \"tenant_id\",\n    \"data_type\": \"uuid\",\n    \"is_nullable\": true,\n    \"column_default\": null,\n    \"description\": \"[FK] Shop UUID\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"column_name\": \"customer_id\",\n    \"data_type\": \"text\",\n    \"is_nullable\": true,\n    \"column_default\": null,\n    \"description\": \"[PK] Customer identifier. JOIN with orders.customer_id\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"column_name\": \"platform\",\n    \"data_type\": \"text\",\n    \"is_nullable\": true,\n    \"column_default\": null,\n    \"description\": \"[Platform] Platform identifier. Always \\\"shopify\\\" for this table\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"column_name\": \"shop_domain\",\n    \"data_type\": \"text\",\n    \"is_nullable\": true,\n    \"column_default\": null,\n    \"description\": \"[Context] Shop domain. Use for multi-store filtering\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"column_name\": \"email\",\n    \"data_type\": \"text\",\n    \"is_nullable\": true,\n    \"column_default\": null,\n    \"description\": \"[Contact] Email address. Use for customer matching: WHERE email = 'customer@example.com'\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"column_name\": \"phone\",\n    \"data_type\": \"text\",\n    \"is_nullable\": true,\n    \"column_default\": null,\n    \"description\": \"[Contact] Phone number. Use for customer communication\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"column_name\": \"first_name\",\n    \"data_type\": \"text\",\n    \"is_nullable\": true,\n    \"column_default\": null,\n    \"description\": \"[Name] First name. Use for personalization\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"column_name\": \"last_name\",\n    \"data_type\": \"text\",\n    \"is_nullable\": true,\n    \"column_default\": null,\n    \"description\": \"[Name] Last name. Use for personalization: CONCAT(first_name, ' ', last_name)\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"column_name\": \"default_address_city\",\n    \"data_type\": \"text\",\n    \"is_nullable\": true,\n    \"column_default\": null,\n    \"description\": \"[Location] Customer city from default address. Use for geo analysis: GROUP BY default_address_city\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"column_name\": \"default_address_country\",\n    \"data_type\": \"text\",\n    \"is_nullable\": true,\n    \"column_default\": null,\n    \"description\": \"[Location] Customer country from default address. Use for country-based filtering\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"column_name\": \"orders_count\",\n    \"data_type\": \"integer\",\n    \"is_nullable\": true,\n    \"column_default\": null,\n    \"description\": \"[Metric] Total orders placed. CRITICAL for segmentation: WHERE orders_count > 5 for VIP customers\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"column_name\": \"total_spent\",\n    \"data_type\": \"numeric\",\n    \"is_nullable\": true,\n    \"column_default\": null,\n    \"description\": \"[Revenue] Customer lifetime revenue. CRITICAL: ORDER BY total_spent DESC for top customers\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"column_name\": \"currency\",\n    \"data_type\": \"text\",\n    \"is_nullable\": true,\n    \"column_default\": null,\n    \"description\": \"[Currency] Customer currency. Match with shop currency for consistency\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"column_name\": \"state\",\n    \"data_type\": \"text\",\n    \"is_nullable\": true,\n    \"column_default\": null,\n    \"description\": \"[Status] Account state. Values: enabled, disabled, invited. Filter: WHERE state = 'enabled'\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"column_name\": \"accepts_marketing\",\n    \"data_type\": \"boolean\",\n    \"is_nullable\": true,\n    \"column_default\": null,\n    \"description\": \"[Flag] Email opt-in. Filter: WHERE accepts_marketing = TRUE for email campaigns\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"column_name\": \"verified_email\",\n    \"data_type\": \"boolean\",\n    \"is_nullable\": true,\n    \"column_default\": null,\n    \"description\": \"[Flag] Email verified status. Filter: WHERE verified_email = TRUE\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"column_name\": \"tags\",\n    \"data_type\": \"text\",\n    \"is_nullable\": true,\n    \"column_default\": null,\n    \"description\": \"[Metadata] Customer tags. Use for segmentation: WHERE tags LIKE '%vip%'\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"column_name\": \"created_at\",\n    \"data_type\": \"timestamp with time zone\",\n    \"is_nullable\": true,\n    \"column_default\": null,\n    \"description\": \"[Timestamp] Customer registration date. Use for cohort analysis: DATE_TRUNC('month', created_at)\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"column_name\": \"updated_at\",\n    \"data_type\": \"timestamp with time zone\",\n    \"is_nullable\": true,\n    \"column_default\": null,\n    \"description\": \"[Timestamp] Last update time. Use for change tracking\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"column_name\": \"raw\",\n    \"data_type\": \"jsonb\",\n    \"is_nullable\": true,\n    \"column_default\": null,\n    \"description\": \"[Raw] Original API response JSONB. Use for debugging or extracting additional fields\"\n  }\n]\n\n"}]}],"system":[{"type":"text","text":"You are a Claude agent, built on Anthropic's Claude Agent SDK."},{"type":"text","text":"Extract any file paths that this command reads or modifies. For commands like \"git diff\" and \"cat\", include the paths of files being shown. Use paths verbatim -- don't add any slashes or try to resolve them. Do not try to infer paths that were not explicitly listed in the command output.\n\nIMPORTANT: Commands that do not display the contents of the files should not return any filepaths. For eg. \"ls\", pwd\", \"find\". Even more complicated commands that don't display the contents should not be considered: eg \"find . -type f -exec ls -la {} + | sort -k5 -nr | head -5\"\n\nFirst, determine if the command displays the contents of the files. If it does, then <is_displaying_contents> tag should be true. If it does not, then <is_displaying_contents> tag should be false.\n\nFormat your response as:\n<is_displaying_contents>\ntrue\n</is_displaying_contents>\n\n<filepaths>\npath/to/file1\npath/to/file2\n</filepaths>\n\nIf no files are read or modified, return empty filepaths tags:\n<filepaths>\n</filepaths>\n\nDo not include any other text in your response."}],"tools":[],"metadata":{"user_id":"user_8c51390cef627ddfb6b4b23b54bfc71738a35d5a5d4a5d6c9a8b5bf17b55c2c7_account__session_526e4945-5391-4f8e-b27f-7b7d5d8ac671"},"max_tokens":32000,"stream":true}
