Body: {"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","messages":[{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Command: npm run get_schema -- semantic.dm_products_shopify\nOutput: \n> data-analysis-skill@1.0.0 get_schema\n> tsx scripts/get_schema.ts semantic.dm_products_shopify\n\nSchema for table \"semantic.dm_products_shopify\":\n[\n  {\n    \"column_name\": \"tenant_id\",\n    \"data_type\": \"uuid\",\n    \"is_nullable\": true,\n    \"column_default\": null,\n    \"description\": \"[FK] Shop UUID\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"column_name\": \"product_id\",\n    \"data_type\": \"text\",\n    \"is_nullable\": true,\n    \"column_default\": null,\n    \"description\": \"[PK] Product identifier. Use for JOIN with order_items, variants\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"column_name\": \"platform\",\n    \"data_type\": \"text\",\n    \"is_nullable\": true,\n    \"column_default\": null,\n    \"description\": \"[Platform] Platform identifier. Always \\\"shopify\\\" for this table\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"column_name\": \"shop_domain\",\n    \"data_type\": \"text\",\n    \"is_nullable\": true,\n    \"column_default\": null,\n    \"description\": \"[Context] Shop domain. Use for multi-store filtering\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"column_name\": \"title\",\n    \"data_type\": \"text\",\n    \"is_nullable\": true,\n    \"column_default\": null,\n    \"description\": \"[Display] Product name. Use in product reports: SELECT title, COUNT(*) FROM order_items GROUP BY product_id\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"column_name\": \"body_html\",\n    \"data_type\": \"text\",\n    \"is_nullable\": true,\n    \"column_default\": null,\n    \"description\": \"[Content] Product description HTML. Use for product content analysis\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"column_name\": \"vendor\",\n    \"data_type\": \"text\",\n    \"is_nullable\": true,\n    \"column_default\": null,\n    \"description\": \"[Segment] Brand/supplier. GROUP BY vendor for brand analysis\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"column_name\": \"product_type\",\n    \"data_type\": \"text\",\n    \"is_nullable\": true,\n    \"column_default\": null,\n    \"description\": \"[Category] Product category. GROUP BY product_type for category performance\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"column_name\": \"handle\",\n    \"data_type\": \"text\",\n    \"is_nullable\": true,\n    \"column_default\": null,\n    \"description\": \"[ID] Product handle (URL slug). Use for URL generation: /products/{\\\"handle\\\"}\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"column_name\": \"tags\",\n    \"data_type\": \"text\",\n    \"is_nullable\": true,\n    \"column_default\": null,\n    \"description\": \"[Metadata] Comma-separated tags. Use for filtering: WHERE tags LIKE '%new%%'\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"column_name\": \"status\",\n    \"data_type\": \"text\",\n    \"is_nullable\": true,\n    \"column_default\": null,\n    \"description\": \"[Status] Product state. Values: active, archived, draft. Filter: WHERE status = 'active'\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"column_name\": \"image_src\",\n    \"data_type\": \"text\",\n    \"is_nullable\": true,\n    \"column_default\": null,\n    \"description\": \"[Media] Main image URL. Use for display\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"column_name\": \"min_price\",\n    \"data_type\": \"numeric\",\n    \"is_nullable\": true,\n    \"column_default\": null,\n    \"description\": \"[Price] Lowest variant price. Use for price range analysis\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"column_name\": \"max_price\",\n    \"data_type\": \"numeric\",\n    \"is_nullable\": true,\n    \"column_default\": null,\n    \"description\": \"[Price] Highest variant price. Use for price range: max_price - min_price\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"column_name\": \"published_at\",\n    \"data_type\": \"timestamp with time zone\",\n    \"is_nullable\": true,\n    \"column_default\": null,\n    \"description\": \"[Timestamp] Publication date. Filter: WHERE published_at IS NOT NULL for live products\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"column_name\": \"created_at\",\n    \"data_type\": \"timestamp with time zone\",\n    \"is_nullable\": true,\n    \"column_default\": null,\n    \"description\": \"[Timestamp] Product creation date. Use for new product analysis: WHERE created_at >= '2025-01-01'\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"column_name\": \"updated_at\",\n    \"data_type\": \"timestamp with time zone\",\n    \"is_nullable\": true,\n    \"column_default\": null,\n    \"description\": \"[Timestamp] Last update time. Use for change tracking\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"column_name\": \"raw\",\n    \"data_type\": \"jsonb\",\n    \"is_nullable\": true,\n    \"column_default\": null,\n    \"description\": \"[Raw] Original API response JSONB. Use for debugging or extracting additional fields\"\n  }\n]\n\n"}]}],"system":[{"type":"text","text":"You are a Claude agent, built on Anthropic's Claude Agent SDK."},{"type":"text","text":"Extract any file paths that this command reads or modifies. For commands like \"git diff\" and \"cat\", include the paths of files being shown. Use paths verbatim -- don't add any slashes or try to resolve them. Do not try to infer paths that were not explicitly listed in the command output.\n\nIMPORTANT: Commands that do not display the contents of the files should not return any filepaths. For eg. \"ls\", pwd\", \"find\". Even more complicated commands that don't display the contents should not be considered: eg \"find . -type f -exec ls -la {} + | sort -k5 -nr | head -5\"\n\nFirst, determine if the command displays the contents of the files. If it does, then <is_displaying_contents> tag should be true. If it does not, then <is_displaying_contents> tag should be false.\n\nFormat your response as:\n<is_displaying_contents>\ntrue\n</is_displaying_contents>\n\n<filepaths>\npath/to/file1\npath/to/file2\n</filepaths>\n\nIf no files are read or modified, return empty filepaths tags:\n<filepaths>\n</filepaths>\n\nDo not include any other text in your response."}],"tools":[],"metadata":{"user_id":"user_8c51390cef627ddfb6b4b23b54bfc71738a35d5a5d4a5d6c9a8b5bf17b55c2c7_account__session_526e4945-5391-4f8e-b27f-7b7d5d8ac671"},"max_tokens":32000,"stream":true}
