alysis/node_modules/@supabase/auth-js/dist/module/GoTrueAdminApi.js\n/Users/salerio/Documents/claude-skills/.claude/skills/data_analysis/node_modules/@supabase/auth-js/dist/main/GoTrueClient.js\n/Users/salerio/Documents/claude-skills/.claude/skills/data_analysis/node_modules/@supabase/auth-js/dist/module/GoTrueClient.js\n/Users/salerio/Documents/claude-skills/.claude/skills/data_analysis/node_modules/@supabase/auth-js/dist/main/lib/helpers.js\n/Users/salerio/Documents/claude-skills/.claude/skills/data_analysis/node_modules/@supabase/auth-js/dist/module/lib/helpers.js\n/Users/salerio/Documents/claude-skills/.claude/skills/data_analysis/node_modules/@supabase/auth-js/dist/main/index.js\n/Users/salerio/Documents/claude-skills/.claude/skills/data_analysis/node_modules/@supabase/auth-js/dist/module/index.js\n/Users/salerio/Documents/claude-skills/.claude/skills/data_analysis/node_modules/@supabase/auth-js/dist/main/lib/local-storage.js\n/Users/salerio/Documents/claude-skills/.claude/skills/data_analysis/node_modules/@supabase/auth-js/dist/module/lib/local-storage.js\n/Users/salerio/Documents/claude-skills/.claude/skills/data_analysis/node_modules/@supabase/auth-js/dist/main/lib/locks.js\n(Results are truncated. Consider using a more specific path or pattern.)"}]},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"我看到了 data_analysis skill 的配置。用户希望创建一个 Shopify 店铺的数据分析页面，并且每个指标需要有数据下钻详情、合理分组、串联起来。\n\nindex.html 文件是空的（只有 1 行）。我需要使用 data_analysis skill 来生成这个页面。\n\n首先，我需要启动 data_analysis skill 来探索数据结构，然后生成完整的分析页面。让我使用 Skill 工具来调用 data_analysis skill。\n\n但是，在调用 skill 之前，我应该先了解用户的具体需求：\n1. 他们想分析哪些 Shopify 数据指标？\n2. 他们如何获取 Shopify 数据（API、数据库等）？\n\n不过，从 data_analysis skill 的描述来看，它支持从 Supabase 数据库查询数据。让我先调用 skill 来探索数据结构。","signature":"e3ba910806cf4770adc0d8f3"},{"type":"text","text":"我看到你打开了 [index.html](index.html) 和 data_analysis skill 的配置。让我使用 data_analysis skill 来为你创建一个完整的 Shopify 店铺数据分析页面。\n\n首先，让我启动 skill 来探索可用数据并生成分析页面："},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call_c6547533e468455cb8b5606b","name":"Skill","input":{"skill":"data_analysis"}}]},{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call_c6547533e468455cb8b5606b","content":"Launching skill: data_analysis"},{"type":"text","text":"Base directory for this skill: /Users/salerio/Documents/claude-skills/.claude/skills/data_analysis\n\n# 数据分析 Skill\n\n利用提供的后端脚本，帮用户生成可交互、动态查询的数据分析页面。用户的数据已集成到 Supabase 中，可以通过本 Skill 提供的脚本安全地查询数据。\n\n## 可用脚本\n\n本 Skill 提供以下脚本用于与 Supabase 交互：\n\n### 1. get_tables\n查看哪些表可以被查询\n\n```bash\nnpm run get_tables\n```\n\n**返回数据格式：**\n```json\n[\n  {\n    \"table_name\": \"semantic.dm_orders_shopify\",\n    \"description\": \"Shopify: Order-level transaction data including totals, financial status, fulfillment status, and timestamps\"\n  }\n]\n```\n\n### 2. get_schema\n查看特定表的结构\n\n```bash\nnpm run get_schema -- <table_name>\n```\n\n**返回数据格式：**\n```json\n[\n  {\n    \"column_name\": \"order_id\",\n    \"data_type\": \"bigint\",\n    \"is_nullable\": false,\n    \"column_default\": \"nextval('orders_order_id_seq')\",\n    \"description\": \"[PK] Unique order identifier\"\n  }\n]\n```\n\n### 3. query\n执行 SQL 查询数据\n\n```bash\nnpm run query -- \"<sql_query>\"\n```\n\n**示例：**\n```bash\nnpm run query -- \"SELECT * FROM semantic.dm_orders_shopify LIMIT 10\"\n```\n\n## 生成数据分析页面的要求\n\n当用户要求数据分析时，按以下步骤进行：\n\n### 1. 数据探索阶段\n- 使用 `get_tables` 了解可用的数据表\n- 使用 `get_schema` 查看相关表的结构和字段说明\n- 根据用户需求选择合适的表和字段\n\n### 2. SQL 查询生成\n- 根据用户分析需求，生成合适的 SQL 查询语句\n- 使用 `query` 脚本执行查询获取数据\n- 确保只使用 SELECT 查询（安全限制）\n\n### 3. 页面生成\n使用以下技术栈生成数据分析页面：\n- **框架**: React (使用函数组件和 Hooks)\n- **样式**: Tailwind CSS\n- **图表**: ECharts\n- **交互**: 支持动态筛选、排序、导出等功能\n- **产物**: 需要在用户的项目中生成产物，而不是生成到 skills 中\n\n### 4. 页面功能要求\n- 图表可视化（折线图、柱状图、饼图等）\n- 响应式设计\n- 加载状态和错误处理\n- 时间筛选（支持按日期范围查询，实现逻辑需要在前端提供时间范围选择器，并且当选择器值改变时，需要替换sql中的时间范围条件，并调用查询）\n\n## 使用示例\n\n**用户输入示例：**\n```\n我想看看 Shopify 订单的销售趋势\n```\n\n**工作流程：**\n1. 调用 `get_tables` 查找相关表（如 `semantic.dm_orders_shopify`）\n2. 调用 `get_schema` 了解表结构和字段\n3. 生成 SQL 查询订单数据（按时间聚合）\n4. 使用 `query` 执行查询获取数据\n5. 生成包含趋势图的 React 页面\n\n## 注意事项\n\n- 所有查询都是只读的（SELECT），确保数据安全\n- 注意货币字段的处理（不同店铺可能有不同货币）\n- 考虑时区转换（使用 `iana_timezone` 字段）\n- 对于大数据集，使用 LIMIT 和分页避免性能问题\n\n## 参考文档\n\n更多详情请参考 [README.md](README.md)"}]},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"好的，现在我已经进入了 data_analysis skill。用户想要创建一个 Shopify 店铺的数据分析页面，要求：\n1. 每个数据指标需要有数据下钻详情\n2. 数据指标需要合理分组\n3. 将数据指标串联起来\n\n首先，我需要探索可用的数据表，然后设计一个合理的分析指标体系。让我开始：\n\n1. 先查看可用的表\n2. 了解表结构\n3. 设计指标分组和下钻逻辑\n4. 生成完整的数据分析页面\n\n让我开始执行。","signature":"473ebcdca3954e758bad2b54"},{"type":"text","text":"好的！我来帮你创建一个完整的 Shopify 店铺数据分析页面，包含数据下钻、指标分组和串联逻辑。\n\n让我先探索可用的数据表结构："},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call_e11ba52117a2477cb2b25207","name":"TodoWrite","input":{"todos":[{"content":"探索可用数据表和结构","status":"in_progress","activeForm":"探索可用数据表和结构"},{"content":"设计指标分组和下钻逻辑","status":"pending","activeForm":"设计指标分组和下钻逻辑"},{"content":"生成数据分析页面","status":"pending","activeForm":"生成数据分析页面"}]}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call_95bc681d2a0b42e7ad84a87c","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/salerio/Documents/claude-skills/.claude/skills/data_analysis && npm run get_tables","description":"Get available tables from Supabase"}}]},{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_e11ba52117a2477cb2b25207","type":"tool_result","content":"Todos have been modified successfully. Ensure that you continue to use the todo list to track your progress. Please proceed with the current tasks if applicable"},{"tool_use_id":"call_95bc681d2a0b42e7ad84a87c","type":"tool_result","content":"> data-analysis-skill@1.0.0 get_tables\n> tsx scripts/get_tables.ts\n\nAvailable tables:\n[\n  {\n    \"table_name\": \"semantic.dm_shop_info_shopify\",\n    \"description\": \"Shopify: Shop-level metadata including name, domain, currency, timezone, and location settings\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"table_name\": \"semantic.dm_orders_shopify\",\n    \"description\": \"Shopify: Order-level transaction data including totals, financial status, fulfillment status, and timestamps\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"table_name\": \"semantic.dm_order_items_shopify\",\n    \"description\": \"Shopify: Line item details for each order including product, quantity, price, discounts, and SKU\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"table_name\": \"semantic.dm_products_shopify\",\n    \"description\": \"Shopify: Product catalog information including title, status, vendor, product type, and tags\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"table_name\": \"semantic.dm_variants_shopify\",\n    \"description\": \"Shopify: Product variant details including SKU, barcode, inventory quantity, price, and option values\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"table_name\": \"semantic.dm_customers_shopify\",\n    \"description\": \"Shopify: Customer profiles including email, phone, orders count, total spent, and lifetime dates\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"table_name\": \"semantic.dm_shopify_pixel_events\",\n    \"description\": \"Shopify: Pixel tracking events for customer behavior including page views, add-to-cart, checkout, and purchases\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"table_name\": \"semantic.dm_ads_campaigns_google\",\n    \"description\": \"Google Ads: Campaign-level performance metrics including impressions, clicks, cost, conversions, and ROAS\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"table_name\": \"semantic.dm_ads_products_google\",\n    \"description\": \"Google Ads: Product-level performance metrics for shopping campaigns including clicks, cost, and conversion data\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"table_name\": \"semantic.dm_ads_keywords_google\",\n    \"description\": \"Google Ads: Keyword-level performance metrics including search terms, bids, quality score, and performance data\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"table_name\": \"semantic.dm_ads_search_terms_google\",\n    \"description\": \"Google Ads: Search term performance metrics showing actual user queries that triggered your ads\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"table_name\": \"semantic.dm_ads_creatives_google\",\n    \"description\": \"Google Ads: Creative and asset-level performance metrics for ads including image and video performance data\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"table_name\": \"semantic.dm_shop_info_bigcommerce\",\n    \"description\": \"BigCommerce: Shop-level metadata including name, domain, currency, timezone, and store settings\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"table_name\": \"semantic.dm_products_bigcommerce\",\n    \"description\": \"BigCommerce: Product catalog information including title, SKU, type, price, inventory status, and images\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"table_name\": \"semantic.dm_variants_bigcommerce\",\n    \"description\": \"BigCommerce: Product variant details including SKU, option values (color/size), price, inventory level, and cost\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"table_name\": \"semantic.dm_customers_bigcommerce\",\n    \"description\": \"BigCommerce: Customer profiles including email, name, phone, registration date, and total lifetime spend\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"table_name\": \"semantic.dm_orders_bigcommerce\",\n    \"description\": \"BigCommerce: Order-level transaction data including order number, totals, tax, discounts, payment method, and status\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"table_name\": \"semantic.dm_order_items_bigcommerce\",\n    \"description\": \"BigCommerce: Order line item details including product name, quantity, price, discounts, and variant information\"\n  }\n]","is_error":false}]},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"太好了！我看到了很多可用的表，包括 Shopify 的订单、产品、客户、广告等数据。让我查看一些关键表的结构来了解字段详情。","signature":"c8ec31ce07bd487e8fb117cd"},{"type":"text","text":"太好了！发现了丰富的 Shopify 数据表。让我查看关键表的结构："},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call_0cd7c8a749c949aea17378c4","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"npm run get_schema -- semantic.dm_orders_shopify","description":"Get orders table schema"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call_88c7fea4f3a54433913e5612","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"npm run get_schema -- semantic.dm_customers_shopify","description":"Get customers table schema"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call_1209bc611bad47839b16c5d6","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"npm run get_schema -- semantic.dm_products_shopify","description":"Get products table schema"}}]},{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_0cd7c8a749c949aea17378c4","type":"tool_result","content":"> data-analysis-skill@1.0.0 get_schema\n> tsx scripts/get_schema.ts semantic.dm_orders_shopify\n\nSchema for table \"semantic.dm_orders_shopify\":\n[\n  {\n    \"column_name\": \"tenant_id\",\n    \"data_type\": \"uuid\",\n    \"is_nullable\": true,\n    \"column_default\": null,\n    \"description\": \"[FK] Shop UUID. JOIN with dm_shop_info_shopify.tenant_id for currency/timezone\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"column_name\": \"order_id\",\n    \"data_type\": \"text\",\n    \"is_nullable\": true,\n    \"column_default\": null,\n    \"description\": \"[PK] Unique order identifier. Use for JOIN with dm_order_items_shopify.order_id\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"column_name\": \"platform\",\n    \"data_type\": \"text\",\n    \"is_nullable\": true,\n    \"column_default\": null,\n    \"description\": \"[Platform] Platform identifier. Always \\\"shopify\\\" for this table\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"column_name\": \"shop_domain\",\n    \"data_type\": \"text\",\n    \"is_nullable\": true,\n    \"column_default\": null,\n    \"description\": \"[Context] Shop domain. Use for multi-store filtering: GROUP BY shop_domain\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"column_name\": \"order_number\",\n    \"data_type\": \"text\",\n    \"is_nullable\": true,\n    \"column_default\": null,\n    \"description\": \"[Display] Human-readable order #. Example: #1001, #1002. Use in customer reports\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"column_name\": \"landing_site\",\n    \"data_type\": \"text\",\n    \"is_nullable\": true,\n    \"column_default\": null,\n    \"description\": \"[Context] Landing page URL. Use for traffic source analysis\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"column_name\": \"referring_site\",\n    \"data_type\": \"text\",\n    \"is_nullable\": true,\n    \"column_default\": null,\n    \"description\": \"[Traffic] Referrer URL. Use for referral traffic analysis\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"column_name\": \"source_name\",\n    \"data_type\": \"text\",\n    \"is_nullable\": true,\n    \"column_default\": null,\n    \"description\": \"[Channel] Sales channel. Values: web, pos, iphone, android. GROUP BY source_name for channel breakdown\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"column_name\": \"gateway\",\n    \"data_type\": \"text\",\n    \"is_nullable\": true,\n    \"column_default\": null,\n    \"description\": \"[Payment] Payment processor. Values: stripe, paypal, shopify_payments. GROUP BY gateway for payment analysis\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"column_name\": \"processing_method\",\n    \"data_type\": \"text\",\n    \"is_nullable\": true,\n    \"column_default\": null,\n    \"description\": \"[Method] Payment processing method. Values: direct, checkout, express, manual\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"column_name\": \"total_price\",\n    \"data_type\": \"numeric\",\n    \"is_nullable\": true,\n    \"column_default\": null,\n    \"description\": \"[Revenue] ORDER TOTAL = subtotal + tax + shipping - discounts. CRITICAL: Use SUM(total_price) for revenue metrics\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"column_name\": \"subtotal_price\",\n    \"data_type\": \"numeric\",\n    \"is_nullable\": true,\n    \"column_default\": null,\n    \"description\": \"[Revenue] Merchandise total before tax/shipping. Use for AOV: AVG(subtotal_price)\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"column_name\": \"total_discounts\",\n    \"data_type\": \"numeric\",\n    \"is_nullable\": true,\n    \"column_default\": null,\n    \"description\": \"[Revenue] Total discount amount. Use discount rate: SUM(total_discounts) / SUM(subtotal_price)\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"column_name\": \"total_tax\",\n    \"data_type\": \"numeric\",\n    \"is_nullable\": true,\n    \"column_default\": null,\n    \"description\": \"[Revenue] Total tax charged. Use for tax reporting: SUM(total_tax) WHERE DATE_TRUNC('month', created_at) = '2025-01-01'\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"column_name\": \"currency\",\n    \"data_type\": \"text\",\n    \"is_nullable\": true,\n    \"column_default\": null,\n    \"description\": \"[Currency] ISO 4217 code (USD, EUR, GBP). Use for multi-currency: GROUP BY currency\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"column_name\": \"financial_status\",\n    \"data_type\": \"text\",\n    \"is_nullable\": true,\n    \"column_default\": null,\n    \"description\": \"[Status] Payment state. Values: paid, pending, authorized, partially_paid, voided. Filter: WHERE financial_status = 'paid'\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"column_name\": \"fulfillment_status\",\n    \"data_type\": \"text\",\n    \"is_nullable\": true,\n    \"column_default\": null,\n    \"description\": \"[Status] Shipping state. Values: fulfilled, partial, restocked, null. Filter: WHERE fulfillment_status = 'fulfilled'\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"column_name\": \"cancelled_at\",\n    \"data_type\": \"timestamp with time zone\",\n    \"is_nullable\": true,\n    \"column_default\": null,\n    \"description\": \"[Timestamp] Cancellation date. Filter: WHERE cancelled_at IS NOT NULL for cancelled orders\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"column_name\": \"cancel_reason\",\n    \"data_type\": \"text\",\n    \"is_nullable\": true,\n    \"column_default\": null,\n    \"description\": \"[Status] Cancellation reason. Values: customer, inventory, fraud, other. GROUP BY for cancellation analysis\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"column_name\": \"customer_id\",\n    \"data_type\": \"text\",\n    \"is_nullable\": true,\n    \"column_default\": null,\n    \"description\": \"[FK] Customer identifier. JOIN with dm_customers_shopify.customer_id for CLV analysis\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"column_name\": \"customer_email\",\n    \"data_type\": \"text\",\n    \"is_nullable\": true,\n    \"column_default\": null,\n    \"description\": \"[Contact] Customer email. Use for matching across systems or email marketing analytics\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"column_name\": \"tags\",\n    \"data_type\": \"text\",\n    \"is_nullable\": true,\n    \"column_default\": null,\n    \"description\": \"[Metadata] Comma-separated tags. Use for custom filters: WHERE tags LIKE '%vip%'\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"column_name\": \"line_items_count\",\n    \"data_type\": \"integer\",\n    \"is_nullable\": true,\n    \"column_default\": null,\n    \"description\": \"[Metric] Number of products in cart. Use for basket size: AVG(line_items_count)\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"column_name\": \"created_at\",\n    \"data_type\": \"timestamp with time zone\",\n    \"is_nullable\": true,\n    \"column_default\": null,\n    \"description\": \"[Timestamp] Order date/time. CRITICAL for time-series: GROUP BY DATE_TRUNC('day', created_at)\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"column_name\": \"updated_at\",\n    \"data_type\": \"timestamp with time zone\",\n    \"is_nullable\": true,\n    \"column_default\": null,\n    \"description\": \"[Timestamp] Last update time. Use for change tracking: WHERE updated_at > created_at\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"column_name\": \"raw\",\n    \"data_type\": \"jsonb\",\n    \"is_nullable\": true,\n    \"column_default\": null,\n    \"description\": \"[Raw] Original API response JSONB. Use for debugging or extracting additional fields\"\n  }\n]","is_error":false},{"tool_use_id":"call_88c7fea4f3a54433913e5612","type":"tool_result","content":"> data-analysis-skill@1.0.0 get_schema\n> tsx scripts/get_schema.ts semantic.dm_customers_shopify\n\nSchema for table \"semantic.dm_customers_shopify\":\n[\n  {\n    \"column_name\": \"tenant_id\",\n    \"data_type\": \"uuid\",\n    \"is_nullable\": true,\n    \"column_default\": null,\n    \"description\": \"[FK] Shop UUID\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"column_name\": \"customer_id\",\n    \"data_type\": \"text\",\n    \"is_nullable\": true,\n    \"column_default\": null,\n    \"description\": \"[PK] Customer identifier. JOIN with orders.customer_id\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"column_name\": \"platform\",\n    \"data_type\": \"text\",\n    \"is_nullable\": true,\n    \"column_default\": null,\n    \"description\": \"[Platform] Platform identifier. Always \\\"shopify\\\" for this table\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"column_name\": \"shop_domain\",\n    \"data_type\": \"text\",\n    \"is_nullable\": true,\n    \"column_default\": null,\n    \"description\": \"[Context] Shop domain. Use for multi-store filtering\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"column_name\": \"email\",\n    \"data_type\": \"text\",\n    \"is_nullable\": true,\n    \"column_default\": null,\n    \"description\": \"[Contact] Email address. Use for customer matching: WHERE email = 'customer@example.com'\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"column_name\": \"phone\",\n    \"data_type\": \"text\",\n    \"is_nullable\": true,\n    \"column_default\": null,\n    \"description\": \"[Contact] Phone number. Use for customer communication\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"column_name\": \"first_name\",\n    \"data_type\": \"text\",\n    \"is_nullable\": true,\n    \"column_default\": null,\n    \"description\": \"[Name] First name. Use for personalization\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"column_name\": \"last_name\",\n    \"data_type\": \"text\",\n    \"is_nullable\": true,\n    \"column_default\": null,\n    \"description\": \"[Name] Last name. Use for personalization: CONCAT(first_name, ' ', last_name)\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"column_name\": \"default_address_city\",\n    \"data_type\": \"text\",\n    \"is_nullable\": true,\n    \"column_default\": null,\n    \"description\": \"[Location] Customer city from default address. Use for geo analysis: GROUP BY default_address_city\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"column_name\": \"default_address_country\",\n    \"data_type\": \"text\",\n    \"is_nullable\": true,\n    \"column_default\": null,\n    \"description\": \"[Location] Customer country from default address. Use for country-based filtering\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"column_name\": \"orders_count\",\n    \"data_type\": \"integer\",\n    \"is_nullable\": true,\n    \"column_default\": null,\n    \"description\": \"[Metric] Total orders placed. CRITICAL for segmentation: WHERE orders_count > 5 for VIP customers\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"column_name\": \"total_spent\",\n    \"data_type\": \"numeric\",\n    \"is_nullable\": true,\n    \"column_default\": null,\n    \"description\": \"[Revenue] Customer lifetime 